+## Browser extension
+
+The MakeMidas extension for Chrome, Edge and Firefox lets you start from anything on the web. Right-click a picture and pick **Create an image from this picture** or **Turn this picture into a video**, or select some text and pick **Create an image from "…"**. The MakeMidas popup opens with the picture or text filled in: choose a model and select **Generate**. Results show in the popup and in your history, and you get a notification when a video is ready. The first time, sign in from the popup and select **Allow**. If a site won't let us download a picture, save it and add it from your computer in the popup.
+
 ## API keys
 
 Use an API key to make images and videos from your own scripts and apps. Create one in **Settings → API Keys** and keep it secret: anyone with the key can spend your credits. If a key leaks, delete it there and create a new one. The API spends the same credits as the website; requests and examples are on the [Developers](/developers#api) page.
